# Gosai Assassin

## Lore

Some Gosai make killing their profession and take it further than any ordinary assassin: they will not pick up a hand to hand weapon at all. In its place they learn Skudasa, an unarmed style found nowhere else that blends martial arts with an assassin''s training and is built around the race''s own claws and the snapping kicks of its pop-hinged knees. About 25-30% of the Gosai follow this path.

In every other way the Gosai Assassin works as any assassin does.

## GM Notes

Treat the class as the Assassin O.C.C. with three differences: Skudasa instead of Hand to Hand: Assassin, four extra skills (Espionage, Military, Rogue, Scholar) instead of four weapon proficiencies, and no W.P., Horsemanship or Disguise ever. Nobody else may learn Skudasa. Some Gosai Assassins have gone abroad to hire out, chiefly in the Western Empire, Timiro, the Old Kingdom and parts of the Eastern Territory.
', 'published', 'data-script'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM imported_classes WHERE class_id = 'gosai-assassin');


